 "description": "Employer coaching queue for one job (DEV-2741; registry op project_todos.quizzes.coaching.read): SUBMITTED quiz to-dos waiting on your review \u2014 masked worker names, latest submitted attempt, \u22643 live cycles with a liveCyclesTruncated conflict signal. Keyset cursor/limit plus C4.5 deterministic filters (contractId, formId, formVersionId, submittedAfter/Before, live-cycle state), echoed back under filters; response view:\"queue\". Worker names are masked; answer keys, expected answers, and worker personal data NEVER appear. Requires project_todos:read, a claimed account, and the default-off project-todos agent surface. Keyless read.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
